{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And you shall despoil, etc.</b> Here He alluded to the permissibility of a person despoiling an oppressor of his property. Or it may allude that through this He would cause Egypt to descend into the depths of the sea, for by means of two stratagems that they would speak of — to go a three days' journey, and also when they would ask of them their vessels — this would cause them to pursue after them and they would descend into the depths."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:24:10.950216123Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}